sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as Celery/Redis
    participant W as Worker

    U->>FE: Sign in
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Validate user
    DB-->>API: User record
    API-->>FE: JWT token

    U->>FE: Upload media
    FE->>API: POST /api/media/upload
    API->>DB: Save MediaAsset(status=queued)
    API->>Q: Enqueue process_media(asset_id)
    API-->>FE: Upload accepted

    Q->>W: Deliver queued task
    W->>DB: Set status=processing
    W->>W: Extract audio / transcribe / summarize / detect entities
    W->>DB: Save transcript, summary, entities, alert_matches
    W->>DB: Set status=completed or alerted

    U->>FE: Refresh dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /api/media
    API->>DB: Read assets
    API-->>FE: Results list
